# polymarket-bot Cline Rules
# Read this before every session

## Project
Autonomous Polymarket crypto betting bot. Three collaborators: Cameron (vcvikings3-debug), Coos (coosara2007), and Terry (GitHub TBD — account pending creation).

## Before Every Commit
1. Update CONTEXT.md — what was built, phase statuses, last commit hash, next steps, who is doing what
2. Never commit without updating CONTEXT.md first
3. Never commit .env

## Branch Rules
- Never push to main directly
- Branch name = what you are building (e.g. phase-4-execution)
- Always open a pull request for Cameron to review

## Code Rules
- Never touch Phases 1-3 code unless fixing a confirmed bug
- Always use loguru for logging
- Always add try/except error handling
- DRY_RUN=true must be default for any betting code

## On Session Start
- Read CONTEXT.md first
- Check Next Steps table to understand current priorities
- Confirm which branch you are on before writing any code
